### Cartagena: peticiones de backend (REST Client VS Code)
### Se envían desde "Send Request". Usa JWT de tu Login real.
@base = http://localhost:8081
@admin = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_ADMIN
@cliente = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_CLIENTE
@libro = LIB-CSHARP-001
@domicilio = 1
@venta = 1
@paquete = 1
@envio = 1

### Gateway, salud C# y catálogo público
GET {{base}}/health

###
GET {{base}}/api/core/health

###
GET {{base}}/api/libros

###
GET {{base}}/api/libros?q=arquitectura

### Login del compañero: copiar token del campo datos.token
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombreUsuario":"admin_demo","contrasena":"CAMBIAR"}

### Registro de CLIENTE del compañero
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombreUsuario":"cliente_csharp","contrasena":"CLAVE_SEGURA","email":"cliente_csharp@example.com","nombreCompleto":"Cliente CSharp","telefono":"6681234567"}

### Crear libro ADMIN
POST {{base}}/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id_libro":"{{libro}}","titulo":"Programación con C#","autor":"Ejemplo académico","precio":249.00,"stock":12,"stock_minimo":3,"stock_maximo":40,"descuento_porcentaje":0}

### Consultar libro
GET {{base}}/api/libros/{{libro}}

### Modificar precio ADMIN
PATCH {{base}}/api/libros/{{libro}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"precio":259.00,"editorial":"Editorial Cartagena"}

### Crear domicilio CLIENTE
POST {{base}}/api/domicilios
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"calle":"Principal","numero":"100","colonia":"Centro","ciudad":"Los Mochis","estado":"Sinaloa","codigo_postal":"81200","telefono":"6681234567"}

### Consultar domicilios
GET {{base}}/api/domicilios
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Poner 2 libros en carrito
PUT {{base}}/api/carrito/{{libro}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cantidad":2}

### Consultar carrito
GET {{base}}/api/carrito
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Checkout simulación — Idempotency-Key fija para probar repetición
POST {{base}}/api/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Idempotency-Key: compra-csharp-demo-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"id_domicilio":{{domicilio}},"tipo_pago":"Tarjeta","sandbox_resultado":"aprobado"}

### Repetir exactamente el mismo checkout; debe devolver repetido=true
POST {{base}}/api/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Idempotency-Key: compra-csharp-demo-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"id_domicilio":{{domicilio}},"tipo_pago":"Tarjeta","sandbox_resultado":"aprobado"}

### Mis pedidos son la tabla venta, sin duplicar registros
GET {{base}}/api/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Detalle pedido
GET {{base}}/api/pedidos/{{venta}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Mis ventas
GET {{base}}/api/ventas
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Detalle venta
GET {{base}}/api/ventas/{{venta}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Historial microservicio Python independiente
GET {{base}}/api/historial-compras
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Ticket generado por C#
GET {{base}}/api/ventas/{{venta}}/ticket.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Resumen ADMIN
GET {{base}}/api/admin/resumen
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Pedidos ADMIN
GET {{base}}/api/admin/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Empaquetar venta confirmada ADMIN
POST {{base}}/api/paquetes
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id_venta":{{venta}},"peso_kg":1.20,"largo_cm":30,"ancho_cm":20,"alto_cm":10}

### Cambiar paquete a Listo
PATCH {{base}}/api/paquetes/{{paquete}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estado":"Listo"}

### Entregar a paquetería
PATCH {{base}}/api/paquetes/{{paquete}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estado":"EntregadoAPaqueteria","numero_guia":"GUIA-12345"}

### Listar envíos
GET {{base}}/api/envios
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Confirmar entrega (solo después de guía y envío)
PATCH {{base}}/api/envios/{{envio}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estado":"Entregado"}

### Garantía cliente (dentro de los 7 días siguientes a la entrega)
POST {{base}}/api/garantias
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id_venta":{{venta}},"id_libro":"{{libro}}","motivo":"Ejemplo de devolución por garantía"}

### Listar garantías
GET {{base}}/api/garantias
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente}}

### Inventario: reporte PDF ADMIN
GET {{base}}/api/inventario/reporte.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Compras a proveedores ADMIN
GET {{base}}/api/compras-proveedor
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Reporte de compras ADMIN
GET {{base}}/api/compras-proveedor/reporte?mes=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Recuperación de cuenta — token llega por SMTP
POST {{base}}/api/cuenta/recuperacion/solicitar
Content-Type: application/json

{"correo":"cliente_csharp@example.com"}

### Negativo: sin JWT -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/carrito

### OpenAPI C#
GET {{base}}/openapi/v1.json
